<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>AI电商助手 | 抢先体验</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f7ff 0%, #e9eef5 100%);
            padding: 2rem 1rem;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 2rem;
            padding: 2rem;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 35px -10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3c72, #2b4c7c);
            background-clip: text;
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        .tagline {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #2c5a7a;
            border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;
            padding-left: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        .hero {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        .hero-text {
            flex: 1;
        }
        .hero-text p {
            margin: 1rem 0;
        }
        .features {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin: 2rem 0;
        }
        .feature-card {
            background: #f8fafc;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 1.5rem;
        }
        .signup-form {
            background: #f0f4fe;
            border-radius: 1.5rem;
            padding: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }
        .form-group {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.8rem;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }
        input, button {
            padding: 0.8rem 1.2rem;
            border-radius: 2rem;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }
        button {
            background: #1e3c72;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 2rem;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: #666;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <h1>🧠 跨境智售 · AI电商助手</h1>
    <div class="tagline">让AI帮你抓住每一笔跨境订单</div>
    <div class="hero">
        <div class="hero-text">
            <p> 智能商品描述生成 — 一键写出高转化文案</p >
            <p> 利润计算 & 定价建议 — 输入成本，AI推荐最优售价</p >
            <p>🤖 7x24小时客服Agent — 自动回复，提升复购</p >
        </div>
        <div class="hero-text" style="text-align:center; font-size:3rem;">🛍️</div>
    </div>
    <div class="features">
        <div class="feature-card"> 30秒生成文案</div>
        <div class="feature-card">🌍 多语言支持</div>
        <div class="feature-card"> 数据驱动决策</div>
    </div>
    <div class="signup-form">
        <h2> 抢先体验</h2>
        <p>留下邮箱，上线第一时间通知你，赠送30天免费高级版。</p >
        <form id="subscribeForm">
            <div class="form-group">
                <input type="email" id="email" placeholder="你的电子邮箱" required>
                <button type="submit">立即预约 →</button>
            </div>
        </form>
        <div id="message"></div>
    </div>
    <footer> 2025 Hapesha AI Forge · 创业第一步</footer>
</div>
<script>
    document.getElementById('subscribeForm').addEventListener('submit', function(e) {
        e.preventDefault();
        let email = document.getElementById('email').value.trim();
        let msgDiv = document.getElementById('message');
        if (!email) {
            msgDiv.innerHTML = ' 请填写邮箱';
            return;
        }
        msgDiv.innerHTML = '✅ 预约成功！感谢支持。';
        document.getElementById('email').value = '';
    });
</script>
</body>
</html>